-- TiDB SQL editor version. Numbered 0275. Run after 0274.
-- One statement per line. Every table is cabinet_dealz.<table>.
-- Do not run this from an application. Tom pastes it in the TiDB editor.
-- This file was NOT executed against production.
-- Insert-only. A code that already exists is skipped. Nothing here changes or removes a row.
--
-- Source: Faircrest Cabinets Product Specification Guide, November 2026 Edition.
-- Descriptions are the guide DESCRIPTION cells, copied exactly.
-- WDC2430, WDC2436 and WDC2442 are standard stocked diagonal corner wall cabinets.
-- They use the same type as DCW2430 / DCW2442: category Wall, subCategory Corner Wall,
-- cornerType diagonal, isCornerCabinet 1, graphicType wall_diagonal_corner.
-- The guide cell already says Diagonal Corner Wall Cabinet. Shelves are the guide line
-- '30" and 36" heights: 2 adjustable shelves; 42" height: 3'.
-- No special-order column exists on cabinet_dealz.cabinets, so none is written.
--
-- W183024, W183624 and W184224 are the 24" deep single-door wall cabinets the guide
-- says to use as the top of a split pantry over a UCB1854. The cabinet schema has
-- category and subCategory, and no collection, stackable, or pantry-program column.
-- subCategory is left NULL. The description stays the guide cell, which does not say pantry.
--
-- Prices are not in the guide. distributor_skus rows copy distributorId, styleId,
-- isAvailable and isPublished from the named template code and set listPrice and yourCost
-- to NULL. A NULL price does not throw. design.placeableCabinets and designer eligibility
-- keep the row out of Auto Design until a published list price or your cost is greater
-- than zero (reason: no published supplier price). The product page shows an em dash for
-- a missing price.
--
-- Left NULL because the guide does not state them: listPrice, yourCost, and any shelf,
-- door, or drawer count not named below. UOC ovenType is NULL because the guide says the
-- cabinet can be a single oven, a double oven, or an oven/microwave.


-- Style links. Prices stay NULL. A second paste adds nothing for a pair that already exists.

SELECT added_cabinet.masterCode, added_cabinet.description, added_cabinet.category, added_cabinet.subCategory, added_cabinet.placementType, added_cabinet.width, added_cabinet.height, added_cabinet.depth, added_cabinet.numberOfDoors, added_cabinet.numberOfDrawers, added_cabinet.numberOfAdjShelves, added_cabinet.cornerType, added_cabinet.weight, (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM cabinet_dealz.distributor_skus AS linked_sku WHERE linked_sku.cabinetId = added_cabinet.id) AS style_link_count FROM cabinet_dealz.cabinets AS added_cabinet WHERE added_cabinet.masterCode IN ('W183024', 'W183624', 'W184224', 'W3DR18', 'W3DR24', 'WDC2430', 'WDC2436', 'WDC2442', 'WOC3312PG', 'UOC3384', 'UOC3390', 'UOC3396', 'FFS24', 'FFS30', 'FFS36', 'FFS42', 'REP9624', 'LVC') ORDER BY added_cabinet.masterCode;
